--   new automatics take the coords of the retired inner distant at the same spot:
--   S-20401 <- KW INN DIST, S-20813 <- GATE-96 INN DIST, S-21013 <- KBSN INN DIST, S-21423 <- GATE INN DIST, S-21625 <- NR INN DIST.
